post-it: Visual artifacting
symptoms:
	Garbled picture
	Colours look wrong
checks:
	Coloured blocks and torn lines from power-on
		shows: from the moment the computer starts, they flicker over the picture
	Scorched GPU heatsink
		shows: in the Workview, the GPU's heatsink is scorched
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the GPU, throw it in the trash
	Get a new GPU from storage
	Install the GPU
	Remount the shell
